{
	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"179c128d15960b94",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"The [[045 - Antechamber.canvas|045 - Antechamber]] has all doors locked at the start of a run.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-660,
			"y":-380,
			"width":360,
			"height":100,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"ce49eb17613a61ae",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"To unlock the doors, you need to find levers on rooms you draft.\n\n[[Find all Antechamber Levers.canvas|Find all Antechamber Levers]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-660,
			"y":-240,
			"width":360,
			"height":140,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"fa677c15db506313",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Rewards\n\n- Access to the [[045 - Antechamber.canvas|045 - Antechamber]]\n- [[Basement Key.canvas|Basement Key]]\n- Progress to accessing [[046 - Room 46.canvas|046 - Room 46]]\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-200,
			"y":-240,
			"width":420,
			"height":200,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"534003692722a2bd",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"By drafting those rooms, pushing the lever and then reaching the [[045 - Antechamber.canvas|045 - Antechamber]] from the correct side, you can enter the [[045 - Antechamber.canvas|045 - Antechamber]] and obtain a [[Basement Key.canvas|Basement Key]] and a note saying that to go up, you need to go down as a reference to the [[Basement.canvas|Basement]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-690,
			"y":-60,
			"width":420,
			"height":200,
			"color":"4"
		}
	],
